WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Demonstration (simulated): the UPIIXIA Agentic Kit, from zero to a deployed product.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Start in an empty folder and clone the kit once.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.500
install.sh --wizard opens a setup page on your own computer.

4
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:21.000
In the page: install the kit, then prepare the project with your name and the event schedule.

5
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Plan: describe your idea. Claude Code drafts the tasks, each with its tests.

6
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:33.000
You approve the plan by typing the project name. Only a person can approve it.

7
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Start your team: Claude Code implements as claude-ana; a second identity, ana-r, reviews. One subscription is enough.

8
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Agents claim tasks and write the tests first: red, then green.

9
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Done goes to review. The reviewer approves, and uak merge runs the checks on the merged result.

10
00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:01.000
The board follows every task: available, in progress, in review, integrated.

11
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:07.000
The last task is integrated, and uak deploy puts the app online.

12
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:14.000
The cafeteria queue board, deployed at its live URL. This was a demonstration with simulated screens.
